flowchart LR
    task[Incoming coding task] --> classify{Task profile}
    classify -->|Ambiguous, repo-scale, high risk| frontier[Frontier tier<br/>Claude Opus 5 or GPT-5.6 Sol]
    classify -->|Daily feature, bug fix, review| balanced[Balanced tier<br/>Claude Sonnet 5]
    classify -->|Repeatable, high-volume work| fast[Fast / cost tier<br/>Gemini 3.6 Flash, GPT-5.6 Luna,<br/>or DeepSeek V4 Pro]
    frontier --> verify[Run acceptance checks]
    balanced --> verify
    fast --> verify
    verify -->|Pass| accept[Accepted result]
    verify -->|Fail or retry budget exceeded| escalate[Escalate to frontier tier]
    escalate --> frontier

    classDef task fill:#1F1B2D,stroke:#1F1B2D,color:#FFFFFF;
    classDef decision fill:#EDE9FE,stroke:#7C5CFC,color:#1F1B2D;
    classDef tier fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#A78BFA,color:#1F1B2D;
    classDef verify fill:#F5F3FF,stroke:#7C5CFC,color:#1F1B2D;
    classDef outcome fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#22C55E,color:#14532D;

    class task task;
    class classify decision;
    class frontier,balanced,fast,escalate tier;
    class verify verify;
    class accept outcome;
